{"pageProps":{"post":{"id":"6Jk2G3fF0lWu2pJcFSe9br","slug":"exploring-dust-apps-how-to-add-ai-to-your-zendesk-help-center","title":"Easily add AI to your Zendesk Help Center - Dust Apps Example #1","description":"At Dust, our goal is to let you add AI to your company's life by making sure you get accurate answers from LLM models using your data. For that, we're building...","body":{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"At Dust, our goal is to let you add AI to your company's life by making sure you get accurate answers from LLM models using your data. For that, we're building strong connectors that sync and organize data continuously to feed them at the right time when you're using one of your agents. ","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"The thing is that because we're building strong, secure and reliable connectors, it takes a little time. And you might need a connector that doesn't exist on Dust yet. ","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"value":"That's where Dust Apps come into play. Dust apps allow you to gather the right data from anywhere and let Dust do the rest.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Dust Apps are basically a list of blocks (","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"value":"curl, chat, data sources, code, etc.","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":") that run one after the other, using each's other results to run. So the possibilities are pretty much unlimited.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Here, we'll see a short example of ","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"value":"how to get human-like answers from your Zendesk Help Center","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":" without having to browse articles for 15 minutes to find the paragraph that holds the answer to your question. ","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FbG8JHZyABk?feature=oembed","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"value":"TLDR; At the end of this article, you will find a link to the Dust App that we are building and be able to clone it. ","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"}],"nodeType":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Build your first app: Talk to your Zendesk Help center as if it was a human","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"heading-2"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"The Dust App we will build in this article searches an answer to the user's questions in your Zendesk's Help Center and answers with the right context. ","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"This can work for your employees if you use Zendesk's Help Center internally to store company information or externally if you want users to be able to interact easily with your help center. Let's do this!","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Add your LLM providers","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"heading-3"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"To create a Dust App, you need at least a ","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"value":"Builder","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":" profile on Dust. You can then head to the builder menu, then click on \"Developer tools\". ","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Because Dust Apps can be used programmatically, we allow you to add your own LLM providers keys, as well as a few other services. You need to go to the 'Providers' tab and add the API keys of the LLM providers you might want to use.","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"751ge4ljeqso"}},"id":"3774hgbSpd6PYEInVTfDe9","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2025-12-03T13:27:17.653Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-03T13:27:17.653Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":2,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"Easily add AI to your Zendesk Help Center - Dust Apps Example #1 - Screenshot-2024-05-06-at-13.25.34.png","description":"Migrated from https://blog.dust.tt/content/images/2024/05/Screenshot-2024-05-06-at-13.25.34.png","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/751ge4ljeqso/3774hgbSpd6PYEInVTfDe9/da18ddcd06d89303a1fa00d41733c14b/Screenshot-2024-05-06-at-13.25.34.png","details":{"size":84959,"image":{"width":1818,"height":1080}},"fileName":"Screenshot-2024-05-06-at-13.25.34.png","contentType":"image/png"}}}},"content":[]},{"data":{},"content":[{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":"Once done, head to ","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"value":"My Apps","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":" tab and click on ","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"value":"Create App","nodeType":"text"},{"data":{},"marks":[],"value":". Name it, mark it private, and we're on the way!","nodeType":"text"}],"nodeType":"paragraph"},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"751ge4ljeqso"}},"id":"rvUpUTkX3w72dEdwqBVrQ","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2025-12-03T13:27:23.733Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-03T13:27:23.733Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":2,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"Easily add AI to your Zendesk Help Center - Dust Ap